  m_text: 'In sequence, for each standard patient:

    TRIAGE -- VISIT -- DISCHARGE

    For
    each red patient: TRIAGE -- visit in emergency room


    Each triage is performed
    by a nurse; each visit by a doctor; after the visit, the patient remains in the
    same room awaiting therapy, performed by the nurse, and the doctor then visits
    the patient for discharge; if a patient is red, all actions except triage must
    be performed by both a nurse and a doctor. Actions can be stopped at any time
    if there is an emergency (red patient).

'
